1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,120
Before the sun rises, the mother
gets up and begins her work.

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:15,800
Her son is still asleep, but she
prepares the fermented batter.

3
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:21,700
When the mitad is hot, she
slowly pours the batter.

4
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:30,620
Eyes appear on the injera. The smell
of fresh injera fills the house.

5
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:39,340
She takes one out and bakes the next,
until there is enough for her family.

6
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:45,380
Her son wakes up and
comes to his mother.

7
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:55,420
His mother serves injera and
shiro. He sits down beside her.

8
00:00:56,820 --> 00:01:04,580
But today, before he eats, her son
first offers his mother a gursha.

9
00:01:05,610 --> 00:01:11,810
Sometimes love needs no words.
One shared bite is enough.
